---
import NewSection from "./NewSection.astro";
---

<section class="padding_sec" id="skills">
  <NewSection text="Skills" color="black" side="left" />

  <div class="skills_info">
    <h2>My Skills</h2>
    <p>Through my studies, internship, and personal projects, I have developed a combination of technical, creative, and communication skills. I enjoy applying these competencies to create and improve digital solutions.</p>
  </div>

  <ul class="skills">
    <li>
      <b>Web Development:</b>
      HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Astro, React, Shopify Liquid, Git/GitHub, Visual Studio Code
    </li>

    <li>
      <b>Design Tools:</b>
      Figma, Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign, Canva, CapCut
    </li>

    <li>
      <b>UX/UI & Digital Design:</b>
      User-centered design, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing, interface design
    </li>

    <li>
      <b>Digital Communication & AI:</b>
      SEO, email marketing, digital content creation, social media, generative AI for learning, coding, and problem-solving
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .skills_info {
    padding: var(--space-m) 0 var(--space-m) var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 65ch;

    p {
      padding-top: var(--space-xs);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  }

  .skills {
    padding-top: var(--space-s);
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .skills li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-m);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .skills_info {
      padding: var(--space-m) var(--space-xs) var(--space-m) var(--space-xs);
      max-width: 65ch;
    }
  }
</style>
